title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf watch exceeded
catalog: CLI command
target: mf watch exceeded
summary: Subtrees left unwatched for want of inotify watches (the budget)

!! Reference

```
Subtrees left unwatched for want of inotify watches (the budget)

Usage: mf watch exceeded [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list   List the subtrees left unwatched for want of budget — the default
  set    Stop watching a subtree, returning its watches to the budget
  clear  Watch a subtree again (fails if the budget has no room)
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json
          Print the raw JSON response body

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
